      "targetText": "Actual PBPS: the unique positive macroscopic defect rootAttributed faithful restatement of the selected macroscopic square-root and first Gram identity in Appendix B, with ASTIS internal completion of the actual canonical range and real root transport. Fan Chen, Sinho Chewi, Jianfeng Lu and Matthew S. Zhang. Other B5/centered/polar/dynamics/main/cost results remain separate.arXiv:2609.06905v1; Lean4.33.0/fixedMathlib · arXiv2609.06905v1 AppendixB1-B5 first identity/B10-B11 and D1; original C2/two Hessian/positive capped eta · faithful paraphraseComplete source statement (Samplinglib restatement)Let E be a finite-dimensional real Hilbert Borel space with canonical volume, including the explicit rank-zero extension. Let V:E→ℝ be C², 0<α≤β, and assume α‖v‖²≤D²V(x)[v,v]≤β‖v‖² for every x,v. As",
