      "targetText": "1. Produce the actual probability laws and reflected conditional operatorUnder the original C², both global Hessian bounds and capped positive η, the accepted actual centered-defect producer gives probability μ,J,ν, the every-y normalized reflected S, stationary disintegration, literal reflection U and selfadjoint contractive mean-preserving scalar T. Align independently produced pullbacks/reflections by their every-observable almost-everywhere action; no alternate kernel or operator is supplied.Λ∈CondKernel(S),Λ1=Λ2=ν,Uf=f∘F (J-a.e.),Tu(y)=∫u(x)S(y,dx) (ν-a.e.).Corresponding Lean step  rcases CenteredDefectOperator.actual_centered_selfadjoint_defect hα hαβ hV hH hη hβη with\n    ⟨hμ,hJ,hν,S,hS,hSd,hSc,hSf,hSs,U,hU,hUi,hUs,M0,hM0,T,hTs,hAll,\n      q,hqa,hTq,hqi,hzero,hD,hDq,hDef,hRest⟩\n  le",
