      "targetText": "8. Exercise the original-input consumer without certificatesThe Test takes the original potential and Hessian/step assumptions, invokes the actual macro theorem, and derives root contractivity from energy and the nonnegativity of ‖Af‖². It does not supply a probability kernel, onto map, defect, root or energy premise.0≤‖Af‖2,‖ΓPf‖2=‖f‖2−‖Af‖2 ⟹ ‖ΓPf‖≤‖f‖.Corresponding Lean step  classical\n  let mY : MeasurableSpace (E × E) :=\n    MeasurableSpace.comap Prod.snd (inferInstance : MeasurableSpace E)\n  letI : MeasurableSpace (E × E) := Prod.instMeasurableSpace\n  letI : Fact (mY ≤ (inferInstance : MeasurableSpace (E × E))) :=\n    ⟨measurable_snd.comap_le⟩\n  dsimp only\n  obtain ⟨hμ,hJ,hν,hHP,hPf,S,hS,hSd,hSc,hSf,hSs,e,he,U,hU,hUi,hUs,T,hTs,\n    hT,hA,hAs,hAn,hPB,Γ,hΓ,hΓSq,hΓP,hΓPSq,hGram,hEnergy,",
